$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A green, chemoselective, and efficient protocol for Paal-Knorr pyrrole
and bispyrrole synthesis using biodegradable polymeric catalyst PEG-SO3H
in water
